{"nodes": [{"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_operacoes", "label": "Feature: Opera\u00e7\u00f5es (posi\u00e7\u00f5es, compra, venda, movimenta\u00e7\u00f5es)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L1-L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No backend a opera\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 a fonte da verdade: cada compra, venda ou exclus\u00e3o rel\u00ea o hist\u00f3rico do par carteira/a\u00e7\u00e3o e recalcula a posi\u00e7\u00e3o do zero."}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_020", "label": "US-020 \u2014 Consultar as posi\u00e7\u00f5es de uma carteira", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_021", "label": "US-021 \u2014 Comprar a\u00e7\u00f5es numa carteira", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_022", "label": "US-022 \u2014 Vender a\u00e7\u00f5es de uma carteira", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_023", "label": "US-023 \u2014 Consultar o hist\u00f3rico de movimenta\u00e7\u00f5es", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_024", "label": "US-024 \u2014 Corrigir um lan\u00e7amento errado", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_posicao_recalculada_do_historico", "label": "Posi\u00e7\u00e3o recalculada a partir do hist\u00f3rico", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L6-L18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Quantidade e pre\u00e7o m\u00e9dio nunca s\u00e3o escritos diretamente: cada compra, venda ou exclus\u00e3o faz o backend reler o hist\u00f3rico do par carteira/a\u00e7\u00e3o e recalcular a posi\u00e7\u00e3o do zero. Por isso a tela rel\u00ea as posi\u00e7\u00f5es no backend em vez de recalcular localmente."}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_correcao_por_exclusao_e_relancamento", "label": "Corrigir \u00e9 excluir e relan\u00e7ar", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L188-L199", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A edi\u00e7\u00e3o de lan\u00e7amento n\u00e3o \u00e9 usada porque o backend n\u00e3o revalida se a nova quantidade deixa a posi\u00e7\u00e3o negativa (decis\u00e3o D-08); a tela oferece apenas excluir, e a exclus\u00e3o \u00e9 f\u00edsica, com rec\u00e1lculo da posi\u00e7\u00e3o pelo hist\u00f3rico restante."}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_compra_sem_preco_digitado", "label": "Compra usa a cota\u00e7\u00e3o do momento, nunca pre\u00e7o digitado", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L94-L113", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O pre\u00e7o unit\u00e1rio \u00e9 o devolvido pelo backend; a tela em nenhum momento aceita ou envia pre\u00e7o do investidor. Fonte de cota\u00e7\u00e3o fora do ar n\u00e3o registra a compra, e a mensagem atribui a falha \u00e0 fonte."}, {"id": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_localizar_carteira_sem_endpoint_proprio", "label": "Localizar a carteira do endere\u00e7o sem endpoint pr\u00f3prio", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": "L26-L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "N\u00e3o existe GET /carteiras/{id}: a carteira do endere\u00e7o \u00e9 localizada numa p\u00e1gina grande da listagem do investidor. Carteira de outro investidor \u00e9 tratada como n\u00e3o encontrada, n\u00e3o como acesso negado, porque o backend n\u00e3o tem autentica\u00e7\u00e3o e a listagem por investidor \u00e9 o \u00fanico filtro dispon\u00edvel."}], "edges": [{"source": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_operacoes", "target": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_020", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_operacoes", "target": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_021", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_operacoes", "target": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_022", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_operacoes", "target": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_023", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_operacoes", "target": "_spec_features_operacoes_spec_us_024", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".spec/features/operacoes/spec.md", "source_location": null, 